  unitName: Champion Aem
  unitId: 50153
  unitNumber: 234
  description: "A swordsman who became a knight in order to follow in the steps of
    his hero, Will of the Republic of La Veda. Will\u2019s most devoted follower,
    Aem couldn\u2019t bear the way Will and Atro appeared to be held in equal regard
    by his peers. Convinced of Will\u2019s superiority, Aem challenged Atro to a
    joust. The joust was called off halfway through, but Aem\u2019s reputation was
    sealed as the knight who\u2019d managed to hold his own against the legendary
    Atro."
  summonDesc: "I bestow upon you this sword<br>as one knight\u2019s vow to another.<br>Go
    forth, gentle warrior."
  fusionDesc: I am not worthy to be mentioned<br>in the same breath as these heroes.<br>I
    have much yet to learn.
  evoDesc: "The weight of this sword <br>isn\u2019t any ordinary weight:<br>It is
    the weight of chivalry!"
  element: 5
  rarity: 3
